      <activity id="7e23c6fa-fefd-5cf3-bb79-c27ffebb99b3" activityNameId="e0753a88-7896-50e9-a2ab-af1c553c24c3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, low voltage, aluminium industry, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, low voltage, aluminium industry, at grid
This dataset describes the transformation from medium to low voltage as well as the distribution of electricity at low voltage.;
UUID: 0b9a5395-b103-38a6-a8d3-8649e9fc0dfd
Included are the electricity production in European Aluminium Industry, the transmission network as well as direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during low-voltage transmission and transformation from medium-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on UTCE data.
Technology: Average technology used to distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air- and SF6-insulated medium-to-low voltage switching stations. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0b9a5395-b103-38a6-a8d3-8649e9fc0dfd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
